WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:05.934
♪♪

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:09.000
Narrator: ALMOND CONSUMPTION
DATES BACK TO BIBLICAL TIMES.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.501
THEY'RE EVEN MENTIONED
IN THE OLD TESTAMENT.

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:13.167
AROUND 100 A.D.,

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:16.167
THE ANCIENT ROMANS SHOWERED
NEWLYWEDS WITH ALMONDS.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:19.567
THIS RITUAL CAME FROM THE BELIEF
THAT THEY INCREASED FERTILITY.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:22.267
BUT TODAY, IT'S THE NUTRITIONAL
VALUE OF ALMONDS

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:25.000
THAT KEEPS US
COMING BACK FOR MORE.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.968
♪♪

00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:30.667
ALMONDS ARE A GUILT-FREE SNACK.

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:35.434
THEY'RE FULL OF VITAMINS,
MINERALS, AND PROTEIN.

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:38.934
MORE THAN 80% OF THE WORLD'S
ALMONDS COME FROM CALIFORNIA,

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:41.968
WHERE GROWING CONDITIONS
ARE IDEAL.

00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:44.567
UPON ARRIVAL AT
A PROCESSING FACILITY,

00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:48.000
THE ALMONDS ARE STILL
ENCASED IN LEATHERY HULLS.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.968
THEY FLOW THROUGH EQUIPMENT
THAT COMBS OUT DEBRIS.

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:55.901
THE NEXT MACHINE, CALLED
A DESTONER, TARGETS ANY ROCKS.

00:00:55.901 --> 00:00:57.167
AIR BLOWS THROUGH IT

00:00:57.167 --> 00:01:01.000
TO SEPARATE THE LIGHTER
ALMONDS FROM THE STONES.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.300
THE ALMONDS TRAVEL BETWEEN
A RUBBER ROLLER AND BELT.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:08.467
THIS SPINS OFF THE HULLS
AND RELEASES THE ALMONDS.

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:13.467
THE OPERATOR PERIODICALLY
EXAMINES THE DE-HULLED ALMONDS.

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:18.501
VIBRATING DECKS WITH SLOTS
SORT THE ALMONDS BY SIZE.

00:01:18.501 --> 00:01:23.501
THE SYSTEM ALSO SHAKES OFF
HULL MATERIAL AND VACUUMS IT UP.

00:01:23.501 --> 00:01:27.634
THE ALMONDS HEAD TO A GRAVITY
TABLE FOR FINER SEPARATION.

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:31.334
THE SPENT HULLS AND OTHER
MATERIAL FLOAT TO ONE SIDE

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:35.100
WHILE HEAVIER CONTAMINANTS
FLOAT TO THE OTHER.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:38.534
THE IN-SHELL ALMONDS
TUMBLE DOWN CHANNELS.

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:41.367
CAMERAS EXAMINE THE SHELLS
FOR IMPERFECTIONS

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.267
AND LOOK FOR CONTAMINANTS.

00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:47.501
THEN A BLAST OF COMPRESSED AIR
KNOCKS THEM OUT OF THE FLOW.

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:48.934
THESE ARE SOME
OF THE CONTAMINANTS

00:01:48.934 --> 00:01:51.868
THAT HAVE BEEN REMOVED.

00:01:51.868 --> 00:01:55.868
AT ANOTHER FACILITY, MACHINERY
WILL NOW GRADE THE ALMONDS

00:01:55.868 --> 00:01:59.968
ACCORDING TO THE CONDITION
OF THEIR SHELLS.

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:03.234
ONCE AGAIN, THE ALMONDS
FALL THROUGH THE OPEN AIR,

00:02:03.234 --> 00:02:06.601
AND A COMPUTERIZED CAMERA
SCANS THEM FOR BROKEN SHELLS

00:02:06.601 --> 00:02:08.300
AND OTHER FLAWS.

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:11.067
♪♪

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:13.701
A COMPRESSED AIR GUN
THEN KNOCKS THE FLAWED ALMONDS

00:02:13.701 --> 00:02:17.167
OUT OF THE MIX.

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:20.067
THE ALMONDS BOUNCE
ALONG A VIBRATING GRID,

00:02:20.067 --> 00:02:25.067
AND ANY KERNELS OR MISSED
SHELL FRAGMENTS FALL THROUGH.

00:02:25.067 --> 00:02:27.467
FINALLY, PEOPLE SORT
THROUGH THE ALMONDS

00:02:27.467 --> 00:02:31.167
AND REJECT ANY THAT
DON'T HAVE PERFECT SHELLS.

00:02:31.167 --> 00:02:33.234
THEY ALSO TOSS OUT
ANY CONTAMINANTS

00:02:33.234 --> 00:02:36.901
THE MECHANIZED
SORTING SYSTEM MISSED.

00:02:36.901 --> 00:02:40.067
SOME BUYERS WILL PAY
A PREMIUM FOR THE BEST NUTS.

00:02:40.067 --> 00:02:43.000
♪♪

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.467
THE ALMONDS WITH BROKEN SHELLS
WILL HAVE THE SHELLS REMOVED.

00:02:46.467 --> 00:02:49.033
♪♪

00:02:49.033 --> 00:02:52.968
THESE RAW ALMONDS
ARE ALSO SORTED BY SIZE.

00:02:52.968 --> 00:02:56.467
THEY FLOW ONTO
A VIBRATING CONVEYOR.

00:02:56.467 --> 00:02:59.534
FURTHER ALONG,
THE CONVEYOR HAS HOLES.

00:02:59.534 --> 00:03:03.701
THE SMALLER ALMONDS FALL THROUGH
THESE HOLES AND INTO BINS.

00:03:03.701 --> 00:03:06.334
THE LARGER ALMONDS
CONTINUE FORWARD.

00:03:06.334 --> 00:03:08.434
THESE LARGER KERNELS
ARE WORTH MORE

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:11.434
AND WILL BE SOLD SEPARATELY
FROM THE SMALLER ONES.

00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:14.067
♪♪

00:03:14.067 --> 00:03:19.000
AS WITH THE IN-SHELL ALMONDS,
GOOD LOOKS ARE IMPORTANT.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.200
A CAMERA PHOTOGRAPHS
THE CASCADING ALMOND KERNELS,

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.767
AND A COMPUTER SCANS THE IMAGES.

00:03:24.767 --> 00:03:27.200
THE SYSTEM KNOCKS
THE LESS-THAN-PERFECT ALMONDS

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.267
OUT OF THE PRODUCTION STREAM.

00:03:29.267 --> 00:03:31.901
♪♪

00:03:31.901 --> 00:03:35.234
NEXT, THE ALMONDS
HEAD TOWARDS A ROBOT.

00:03:35.234 --> 00:03:37.767
ALONG THE WAY, ANOTHER CAMERA
SENDS THE IMAGES

00:03:37.767 --> 00:03:40.467
TO A COMPUTER SCANNER.

00:03:40.467 --> 00:03:43.901
THIS ONE HAS BEEN PROGRAMMED
TO FIND CHIPS, SCRATCHES,

00:03:43.901 --> 00:03:47.934
AND EVEN SMALL BROKEN BITS.

00:03:47.934 --> 00:03:49.634
THE COMPUTER SENDS
THE COORDINATES

00:03:49.634 --> 00:03:52.467
OF THE DAMAGED ALMONDS
TO THE ROBOT.

00:03:52.467 --> 00:03:57.033
THE ROBOT THEN FINDS THEM
AND PLUCKS THEM OUT OF THE MIX.

00:03:57.033 --> 00:04:00.868
A HUMAN INSPECTOR NOW
PICKS OUT ANY IMPERFECT ALMONDS

00:04:00.868 --> 00:04:04.033
THAT THE ROBOTIC SYSTEM MISSED.

00:04:04.033 --> 00:04:06.334
THEIR FLAWS
ARE JUST SUPERFICIAL.

00:04:06.334 --> 00:04:08.000
THEY STILL TASTE THE SAME,

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:11.200
SO THESE ALMONDS WILL BE
PROCESSED INTO CHOCOLATE BARS,

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:16.067
ALMOND BUTTER OR MILK,
BAKED GOODS AND CEREALS.

00:04:16.067 --> 00:04:18.934
THE PERFECT ALMOND KERNELS
TRAVEL FORWARD.

00:04:18.934 --> 00:04:20.934
♪♪

00:04:20.934 --> 00:04:24.067
JUST AHEAD, MACHINERY
MOVES CARDBOARD BOXES

00:04:24.067 --> 00:04:27.501
INTO AN OPEN POSITION
ON A PACKAGING CAROUSEL.

00:04:27.501 --> 00:04:30.200
SPRAYERS APPLY GLUE
TO THE BOTTOM FLAPS,

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:35.033
AND PUSHERS CLOSE THEM,
SEALING THE BOXES.

00:04:35.033 --> 00:04:37.334
THE ALMONDS NOW ARRIVE
AT A SCALE.

00:04:37.334 --> 00:04:39.133
IT RELEASES THEM INTO THE BOXES

00:04:39.133 --> 00:04:41.934
IN APPROXIMATELY
50-POUND BATCHES.

00:04:41.934 --> 00:04:44.767
♪♪

00:04:44.767 --> 00:04:48.133
THESE BIG BOXES OF ALMONDS WILL
BE SHIPPED TO OTHER FACILITIES

00:04:48.133 --> 00:04:51.601
TO BE PROCESSED
INTO OTHER PRODUCTS.

00:04:51.601 --> 00:04:55.000
SMALLER AMOUNTS WILL BE PACKAGED
FOR CONSUMER USE.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.000
♪♪

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:00.734
A SNACK ANYONE CAN CRACK
OR ENJOY PRE-CRACKED,

00:05:00.734 --> 00:05:03.767
ALMONDS ARE A NATURAL
AND NUTRITIOUS CHOICE.

00:05:03.767 --> 00:05:07.200
NO WONDER THEY'RE CONSUMED
BY THE HANDFUL.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.968
♪♪

